#, fuzzy
msgid "The March newsletter has been sent. Learn about what's new with Java 17 and containers, read about LogicDrop and Vaadin's path to using Quarkus, and get a look at Continuous testing with Quarkus. Additionally, you'll get more insights into how Keycloak is ow fully cloud-native with Quarkus and learn how to create your first API with Kotlin and Quarkus. Also see the lastest Quarkus Insights episodes and upcoming Quarkus attended events."
msgstr "三月份的通讯已经发出。了解Java 17和容器的新特性，阅读LogicDrop和Vaadin使用Quarkus的路径，并了解Quarkus的持续测试。此外，你将获得更多关于Keycloak如何使用Quarkus完全云原生的见解，并学习如何使用Kotlin和Quarkus创建你的第一个API。另外，请看最新的Quarkus Insights剧集和即将到来的Quarkus出席活动。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Check out https://quarkus.io/newsletter/18/[Newsletter #18]!"
msgstr "查看 link:https://quarkus.io/newsletter/18/[第18期通讯]"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Want to get newsletters in your inbox? https://quarkus.io/newsletter[Sign up for the newsletter] using the on page form."
msgstr "想在收件箱中收到时事通讯？使用页面上的表格 link:https://quarkus.io/newsletter[注册时事通讯] 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "We've also included the list of the newest found online stories. Give it a read and if you feel something is missing or have an article coming out for future Quarkus Newsletter install the https://github.com/quarkusio/url2quarkuspub[bookmarklet] on your laptop and phone to easily submit a story. If you prefer the manual way please https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkusio.github.io/issues[open an issue] with a short description and a url."
msgstr "我们还收录了最新发现的在线故事列表。如果您觉得缺少什么，或者有文章要发表在未来的《Quarkus 新闻通讯》上，请在笔记本电脑和手机上安装 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/url2quarkuspub[书签] ，以便轻松提交报道。如果您喜欢手动方式，请 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkusio.github.io/issues[打开一个] 带有简短描述和网址的问题。"
